  "id": "individualized-instruction",
  "term": "individualized instruction",
  "definition": "Individualized instruction is a personalized teaching approach that adapts learning activities or intervention pathways to a learner’s inferred characteristics rather than giving everyone the same curriculum. In this source, it means using predicted personality-related profiles from color perception preferences to tailor art-education instruction in a closed-loop way.",
